#. module: my_compassion
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:my_compassion.my2_user_settings_page
msgid ""
"Compassion knows that children living in extreme\n"
"                                        poverty are vulnerable.\n"
"                                        We put their protection as our number one priority.\n"
"                                        We ask our volunteering\n"
"                                        friends and people that travel to visit their\n"
"                                        sponsored child to sign a\n"
"                                        child protection charter. If you want to make a step\n"
"                                        further, you can sign\n"
"                                        this document as well and show us that you share our\n"
"                                        values.\n"
"                                        <br/>\n"
"                                        Compassion is\n"
"                                        also serious about the protection of your data. All\n"
"                                        your information is kept private and only used\n"
"                                        internally. You can sign or review our data\n"
"                                        protection policy from here."
msgstr ""
"Compassion vet att barn som lever i extrem\n"
"                                        fattigdom är sårbara.\n"
"                                        Vi sätter deras skydd som vår högsta prioritet.\n"
"                                        Vi ber våra frivilliga\n"
"                                        vänner och personer som reser för att besöka sitt\n"
